WEBVTT

1
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,040
Do you have any needs?

2
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,340
I came over to buy some props

3
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,460
It turns out that the nobles of the Fox family are here.

4
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,700
If you need anything, just ask me

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,920
This is the time our store will refresh today. Please choose slowly first.

6
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,200
I'll prepare tea for you

7
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,200
Is rose flavor okay?

8
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,560
Okay, thank you for your hard work

9
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,020
When I went through the monster shop in my previous life

10
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:01,420
The baby can't even stand next to her

11
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,380
Asking about chores and rolling your eyes

12
00:01:04,310 --> 00:01:05,750
It turns out that it’s all about money.
